WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.745
Danny: This place is boring.

2
00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:06.810
Brad: It's school ,

3
00:00:06.811 --> 00:00:08.580
Danny. We have to go.

4
00:00:08.581 --> 00:00:11.670
Tina: Yes. It's nice to be back.

5
00:00:11.671 --> 00:00:15.769
Danny: Remember what we were doing a week ago!

6
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.677
Tina: Has it been only a week?

7
00:00:18.678 --> 00:00:22.377
Brad: It feels like a lifetime ago.

8
00:00:22.378 --> 00:00:26.956
Danny: Don't you want to go back to Ginormous?

9
00:00:26.957 --> 00:00:29.685
Tina: We already saved Ginormous.

10
00:00:29.686 --> 00:00:33.010
There's no reason to go back.

11
00:00:33.011 --> 00:00:35.764
Danny: We could have another adventure!

12
00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:38.574
Tina: We don't have any magic clay, Danny.

13
00:00:38.575 --> 00:00:48.494
Brad: She's right. And we have to go to school, anyway.

14
00:00:48.495 --> 00:00:51.709
Danny: I think Hopian would be happy to see us.

15
00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.472
Tina: Shh! Don't talk too loudly about our adventure.

16
00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:59.493
Brad: Yeah, no one would believe what we were saying.

17
00:00:59.494 --> 00:01:10.369
Mr. Smith: Children, please open your books to page fifty.

18
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.102
Brad: Danny, why don't you play with me?

19
00:01:13.103 --> 00:01:16.721
Danny: Are you attacking evil giants on your computer?

20
00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:19.049
Brad: No. It's a new math program.

21
00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.072
I can calculate─

22
00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:28.764
Danny: I'm not interested!

23
00:01:28.765 --> 00:01:33.893
Chuck: Ha. Your girlfriend is not playing with you anymore!

24
00:01:33.894 --> 00:01:36.319
Danny: She's not my girlfriend!

25
00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.212
Dave: He loves her!

26
00:01:38.213 --> 00:01:44.134
Brad: Listen, just leave us alone.

27
00:01:44.135 --> 00:01:46.984
Chuck: We could hurt you really

28
00:01:46.985 --> 00:01:48.255
bad. Danny: Don't try

29
00:01:48.256 --> 00:01:52.295
it. I've got a friend, a really big

30
00:01:52.296 --> 00:01:55.297
friend─ Brad: Danny! Don't say any

31
00:01:55.298 --> 00:02:01.335
more! Dave: No. I want to hear about your big

32
00:02:01.336 --> 00:02:03.298
friend. Tina: Will you two go

33
00:02:03.299 --> 00:02:05.844
away? Danny: Tina, I don't need your

34
00:02:05.845 --> 00:02:08.558
help. I'll get Hopian to punish

35
00:02:08.559 --> 00:02:09.692
them! Chuck:

36
00:02:09.693 --> 00:02:13.761
Who? Dave: He must have another

37
00:02:13.762 --> 00:02:17.744
girlfriend! "Hopian." What a stupid name!

38
00:02:17.745 --> 00:02:25.121
Chuck: I thought it would be "Peaches" or "Lovey Dovey!" Hoo, hoo, hoo!

39
00:02:25.122 --> 00:02:27.845
Danny: You'll be sorry you teased me!

40
00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:34.984
Dave: You can't hurt us. See ya, loser!

41
00:02:34.985 --> 00:02:38.430
Tina: Danny, we promised each other not to mention Hopian.

42
00:02:38.431 --> 00:02:40.867
Danny: Chuck and Dave are bullies!

43
00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:43.546
I wanted to scare them.

44
00:02:43.547 --> 00:02:46.349
Brad: I don't think that's a good idea.

45
00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:49.932
Danny: You're as dull as our teachers, Brad.

46
00:02:49.933 --> 00:02:52.614
Brad: I'm just cautious.

47
00:02:52.615 --> 00:02:57.265
Danny: You weren't cautious when we were trying to save Ginormous!

48
00:02:57.266 --> 00:02:58.953
Brad :We're back home now.

49
00:02:58.954 --> 00:03:02.574
Things are different.

50
00:03:02.575 --> 00:03:04.280
Danny: I don't care.

51
00:03:04.281 --> 00:03:09.739
I think everyone should know what we did.

52
00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.433
Tina: What is he doing?

53
00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.019
He hates soccer.

54
00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.451
Soccer player: Hey, you can't use your hands!

55
00:03:17.452 --> 00:03:22.925
Brad: I've got a bad feeling about this.

